Pilot rework record, 2026-09-26
1. Direct non-escalated curl could not fetch remote evidence. Authorized escalated read-only requests captured Ford and Dorman pages. MotoRad direct HTTP returned a denial (103-byte motorad.html); manufacturer's indexed primary specifications were read with web retrieval and saved as motorad-web-extract.json.
2. First neighbor-check pass raised ValueError because build123d Location does not multiply Vector. Fixed by transforming Vertex then taking its center. Body and seal topology checks had passed before the error.
3. First rendering attempt raised ModuleNotFoundError: matplotlib in CAD environment; bundled Python also lacks matplotlib. No environment modification made. Used bundled Pillow/NumPy for deterministic shaded triangle rendering.
4. First installed render selected cover triangles by centroid; large planar triangles protruded from the crop. Replaced selection with an exact CAD Boolean crop of the frozen cover before tessellation. Re-ran build/check to update checker hash and render data.
